{
    "zh-CN": {
        "Trunks": "Trunks",
        "And so he left, putting his fear aside.": "于是他离开了，将恐惧抛诸脑后。",
        "KINGMOD_TRUNKS_SKIN_DBS": "龙珠超 (DBS)",
        "KINGMOD_TRUNKS_SKIN_DBZ": "龙珠Z (DBZ)",
        "Saiyan Blood": "赛亚人血统",
        "Skills also require <color=#03bcff>Ki</color> to be used!\nPerform a <color=#FF5400>Main Transformation</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>C</color> (View Transformations Tab for more info).\n<color=#FF5400>Power down</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>X</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Fly</color> by holding <color=#03f4fc>Jump</color>.": "使用技能还需要消耗<color=#03bcff>气</color>！\n轻按<color=#03f4fc>C</color>进行<color=#FF5400>主变身</color>（更多信息请查看“变身”标签页）。\n轻按<color=#03f4fc>X</color><color=#FF5400>解除变身</color>。\n按住<color=#03f4fc>跳跃</color>进行<color=#FF5400>飞行</color>。",
        "Sword Strike": "剑击",
        "Deal <color=#E5C962>320% Damage</color> each strike!\nGain <color=#03bcff>9% Ki</color> Per Hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Auto-moves to targeted enemies.</color>": "每次斩击造成<color=#E5C962>320%伤害</color>！\n每次命中恢复<color=#03bcff>9%气</color>！\n<color=#03f4fc>自动朝目标敌人移动。</color>",
        "Sword Strike Alternate": "剑击（替代）",
        "Deal <color=#E5C962>320% Damage</color> each strike!\nGain <color=#03bcff>9% Ki</color> Per Hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Free movement, but does not Auto-Move.</color>": "每次斩击造成<color=#E5C962>320%伤害</color>！\n每次命中恢复<color=#03bcff>9%气</color>！\n<color=#03f4fc>可自由移动，但不会自动追踪。</color>",
        "Shining Sword Attack": "闪耀剑击",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>30 Ki</color>\nDash towards a target and rapidly unleash a barrage of sword strikes! \nDealing <color=#E5C962>240% Damage</color> for each one!\n<color=#03f4fc>Holding this skill drains </color><color=#03bcff>10% Ki </color><color=#03f4fc>per second.</color>\nOnce released, unleash an additional energy blast, dealing <color=#E5C962>660% Damage</color>!": "消耗<color=#03bcff>30气</color>\n冲向目标并快速施展剑击连段！\n每一击造成<color=#E5C962>240%伤害</color>！\n<color=#03f4fc>按住此技能每秒消耗</color><color=#03bcff>10%气</color><color=#03f4fc>。</color>\n松开后额外释放一道能量波，造成<color=#E5C962>660%伤害</color>！",
        "Ki Charge": "气力充能",
        "Hold and Regenerate <color=#03bcff>20% Ki</color> Per Second!": "按住以每秒恢复<color=#03bcff>20%气</color>！",
        "Flip": "空翻",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>20 Ki</color>\nPerform a quick flip in a direction.\n<color=#03f4fc>Gain Invulnerability whilst skill is active</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>20气</color>\n向指定方向快速空翻。\n<color=#03f4fc>技能持续期间获得无敌状态</color>",
        "Burning Attack": "燃烧攻击",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>50 Ki</color>\nPerform a series of rapid arm movements, firing a flaming explosive ball of energy! \nExplodes on hit, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1700% Damage</color>!\n": "消耗<color=#03bcff>50气</color>\n快速挥动手臂结印，发射一颗燃烧的爆炸能量球！\n命中时爆炸，造成<color=#E5C962>1700%伤害</color>！\n",
        "Swift Massacre": "极速屠戮",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nVanish at light speed and swiftly strike nearby enemies in front dealing <color=#E5C962>1400% Damage</color>!\n<color=#03f4fc>Additional Damage is dealt when the same target is hit more than once.</color>\n<color=#03f4fc>Duration can be extended at the cost of </color><color=#03bcff>80 Ki</color><color=#03f4fc> per second!</color>\n<color=#999999>The number of strikes scales off attack speed.</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>100气</color>\n以光速消失并迅速斩击前方附近的敌人，造成<color=#E5C962>1400%伤害</color>！\n<color=#03f4fc>同一目标被多次命中时会受到额外伤害。</color>\n<color=#03f4fc>每秒可消耗</color><color=#03bcff>80气</color><color=#03f4fc>以延长持续时间！</color>\n<color=#999999>攻击次数随攻击速度提高。</color>",
        "Change The Future": "改变未来",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nQuickly fire a large explosion! \nDamaging all enemies in front, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1000% Damage</color>!\n": "消耗<color=#03bcff>100气</color>\n快速引发一场大型爆炸！\n伤害前方所有敌人，造成<color=#E5C962>1000%伤害</color>！\n",
        "Heat Dome Attack": "热穹攻击",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nGenerate immense power to fire an energy wave upwards, dealing <color=#E5C962>3600% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!\nBurn nearby enemies while charging, dealing <color=#E5C962>300% Damage</color> per second!\nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1600% Damage</color> and size per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>100气</color>\n积蓄庞大能量并向上发射能量波，光束持续期间每秒造成<color=#E5C962>3600%伤害</color>！\n蓄力时灼烧附近敌人，每秒造成<color=#E5C962>300%伤害</color>！\n消耗额外气，每蓄力一秒使伤害提高<color=#E5C962>1600%伤害</color>并扩大范围！\n<color=#03f4fc>蓄力越久，气的消耗逐渐增加！</color>",
        "Inexperienced Power Up": "不成熟的强化",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>50 Ki</color>\nChannel your Saiyan strength, gaining <color=#E5C962>30% Damage</color> and <color=#00FF00>15% Health Regen</color> for 10 seconds!": "消耗<color=#03bcff>50气</color>\n引导你的赛亚人力量，获得<color=#E5C962>30%伤害</color>与<color=#00FF00>15%生命再生</color>，持续10秒！",
        "Masenko": "魔闪光",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>70 Ki</color>\nUnleash the signature Masenko, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1850% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!": "消耗<color=#03bcff>70气</color>\n释放招牌魔闪光，光束持续期间每秒造成<color=#E5C962>1850%伤害</color>！",
        "Sword Of Hope": "希望之剑",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nWith an unwavering spirit, summon the Sword of Hope\nGranting a bonus <color=#E5C962>80% Damage</color> and <color=#E5C962>60% Critical Strike Chance</color> while active.\n<color=#03f4fc>This skill requires </color><color=#097CFF>Light Charge </color><color=#03f4fc>to be full and consumes it over time</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>300气</color>\n以不屈的意志召唤希望之剑\n激活期间提供额外<color=#E5C962>80%伤害</color>与<color=#E5C962>60%暴击率</color>。\n<color=#03f4fc>此技能需要</color><color=#097CFF>光之充能</color><color=#03f4fc>充满，并会随时间消耗</color>",
        "None": "无",
